s based on the Malibu version was released.\nIn the Malibu version of Ex-Mutants, there were three males (Dillon, Ackroyd and Bud) and three females (Shannon, Piper and Tanya). These six were mutants who were gathered by Professor Kildare, a robotic-looking cyborg and turned into humans. Ackroyd and Shannon were the playable characters in the Sega Genesis game.", "summary": "Action game based on the Ex-Mutants comic book series by Malibu Comics.\n\nLeaping from the pages of the popular comic book come the Ex-Mutants. Choose Shannon or Ackroyd as you weave your way through the nuclear wasteland to battle the minions of the evil Sluggo and restore the human race!", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/ex-mutants", "videos": [{"id": 14111, "name": "Gameplay video", "video_id": "USKEvDGXVwc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=USKEvDGXVwc", "title": "Mega Drive Longplay [405] Ex-Mutants", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/USKEvDGXVwc/sddefault.jpg"}]}